#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:5 853ee217d26841cea94d1f8a85a1d778
msgid "Boat Mode"
msgstr "船模式"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:7 1c67c6862b3a481cb78a7d63191a6a5f
msgid ""
"Archived: Superceded by the :ref:`common-moving-vehicle-initialization` page"
msgstr "已归档：已被 :ref:`common-moving-vehicle-initialization` 页面取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:9 4efef72439df483a91e6c803355ea285
msgid ""
"Copter includes \"boat mode\" which allows taking off from a moving platform"
" including boats.  It is not really a \"mode\" but rather a change to how "
"the gyros are calibrated."
msgstr "飞行器包含\"船模式\"，允许从移动平台（包括船只）起飞。这实际上不是一个\"模式\"，而是对陀螺仪校准方式的更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:15 2945f6b78b9043cd8b7f47dcd30c8b0e
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:17 4d8068ddb6624bd9b4cceee3f95963a1
msgid ""
"In many cases Copter will be able to take off from a moving platform without"
" any special parameter changes as long as the platform is not moving too "
"rapidly during the gyro calibration which occurs a few seconds after startup"
" (look for the LEDs flashing red and blue)."
msgstr ""
"在很多情况下，只要平台在启动后几秒内（寻找红蓝交替闪烁的LED）进行陀螺仪校准时移动不太剧烈，飞行器无需任何特殊参数更改即可从移动平台起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:19 fdaa2d1ba885468897ada9d42cdf347b
msgid ""
"If the platform is moving too much however, the gyro calibration will fail "
"after 30 seconds and gyro related warnings like \"Bad Gyro Health\" will "
"appear on the HUD.  Despite this warning the vehicle may fly normally but "
"having the warning is unnerving and may hide other errors.  In this case, it"
" is best to disable the automatic gyro calibration by setting the "
":ref:`INS_GYR_CAL <INS_GYR_CAL>` parameter to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"但如果平台移动过于剧烈，陀螺仪校准将在30秒后失败，HUD上会出现\"Bad Gyro "
"Health\"等陀螺仪相关警告。尽管有此警告，飞行器可能仍能正常飞行，但警告令人不安且可能掩盖其他错误。在这种情况下，最好通过将 "
":ref:`INS_GYR_CAL <INS_GYR_CAL>` 参数设置为\"0\"来禁用自动陀螺仪校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:22 34c8ebb09c0a4db8a05eb6c131e2adb7
msgid "Manually trigger gyro calibration"
msgstr "手动触发陀螺仪校准"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:24 92b332814b0344fa9962b5dc4e027eb8
msgid ""
"Note that even with automatic gyro calibration disabled, the gyros "
"calibration can be triggered manually from the Mission Planner (and perhaps "
"some other ground stations) using the Flight Data screen's Actions tab.  "
"Select \"PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION\" from the top-left drop-down and then press "
"the \"Do Action\" button."
msgstr ""
"请注意，即使禁用了自动陀螺仪校准，仍可以从Mission "
"Planner（以及可能的其他地面站）的飞行数据界面的Actions标签页手动触发陀螺仪校准。从左上角下拉菜单中选择\"PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION\"，然后按\"Do"
" Action\"按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/boat-mode.rst:29 6d6934d822ae47a0a9033df84cfb2375
msgid ""
"This is useful if for some reason a gyro calibration is required and the "
"vehicle can be temporarily placed on a near non-moving platform."
msgstr "如果出于某种原因需要陀螺仪校准，而飞行器可以暂时放置在近乎静止的平台上，这很有用。"
